#. de: bronzen[a] Kleinod
#. fr: trésor insoupçonné de grade I
#. column 2: sacks of silvered Light
#. column 8: This silky bag containing a portion of the Accursed Hoard from Pilgrim's Traverse has been sealed with powerful magicks. Only an appraiser who delights in discoveries above all else might be able to undo such a seal.
#. column 9: Sack of Silvered Light
