msgctxt "Item:47742:0:8"
msgid "This silky bag containing a portion of the Blessed Hoard from Pilgrim's Traverse has been sealed with powerful magicks. Only an appraiser who delights in discoveries above all else might be able to undo such a seal."
msgstr "Шёлковый мешочек с частью Благословенной сокровищницы, найденной на Пути пилигрима. Он запечатан мощной магией. Снять печать, возможно, сможет лишь оценщик, который превыше всего ценит открытия."

#. ja: 輝かしき財宝
#. de: Kleinod des Gesegneten Horts
#. fr: Trésor lumineux
#. column 0: sack of First Light
#. column 2: sacks of First Light
#. column 8: This silky bag containing a portion of the Blessed Hoard from Pilgrim's Traverse has been sealed with powerful magicks. Only an appraiser who delights in discoveries above all else might be able to undo such a seal.
msgctxt "Item:47742:0:9"
msgid "Sack of First Light"
msgstr "Мешочек Первого света"

