#. de: Uhrwerk-Unterdrücker
#. fr: oppresseur mécanique
#. column 2: clockwork oppressors
#. column 8: Painted a rugged shade of green, this miniature machina is a scale replica of the full-size model deployed in military training exercises.<br><br>Use item to acquire the clockwork oppressor minion.
